Powerfarm patch 0003: expose the user's verified-email state to plugins.

EmDash stores User.emailVerified, but the read-only user shape plugins receive
(ctx.user on routes, ctx.users.get/getByEmail/list) drops it. Powerfarm's OIDC
provider must not claim email_verified unless EmDash verified the address.
Adds an optional boolean to UserInfo, filled where the host knows it. Generic,
no Powerfarm concepts; intended to be proposed upstream.

